From: relay12 contributors
Subject: [PATCH] d3d11on12: satisfy Clang on EntryPointHr and the execute-command noexcept

Two unrelated -Werror failures in the same file.

OPEN_TRYCATCH declares EntryPointHr and CLOSE_TRYCATCH_AND_STORE_HRESULT
assigns it, but several entry points read it only through assert(), which
compiles out under NDEBUG. Clang then reports it as set-but-unused at four
sites in device.cpp. Marking the declaration [[maybe_unused]] in the macro
fixes every current and future site at once and changes no behavior: the
variable is still assigned and still read wherever a real read exists.

Pre/PostExecuteCommandQueueCommand are declared through STDMETHOD and
defined through STDMETHODIMP_, and mingw-w64 is asymmetric between the
two: combaseapi.h line 53 expands STDMETHOD with COM_DECLSPEC_NOTHROW,
while basetyps.h line 26 expands STDMETHODIMP_ without it. The
declaration therefore carries __attribute__((nothrow)) and the definition
does not, which Clang rejects as a mismatched exception specification.
The MSVC SDK puts COM_DECLSPEC_NOTHROW on both, which is why this builds
there.

Every other entry point in device.cpp already carries an explicit
noexcept for exactly this reason; these two were missed. noexcept is also
accurate rather than merely silencing: the bodies are wrapped in
OPEN_TRYCATCH/CLOSE_TRYCATCH, which catches and converts to HRESULT, so
nothing propagates out. The declarations get the same explicit noexcept
so the contract is stated rather than inherited from a macro expansion.
---
diff --git a/include/device.hpp b/include/device.hpp
index a2d2894..0875598 100644
--- a/include/device.hpp
+++ b/include/device.hpp
@@ -295,8 +295,8 @@ namespace D3D11On12
         STDMETHOD_(void, SetMaximumFrameLatency)(UINT MaxFrameLatency) noexcept override;
         STDMETHOD_(bool, IsMaximumFrameLatencyReached)() noexcept override;
         STDMETHOD(CloseAndSubmitGraphicsCommandListForPresent)(BOOL commandsAdded, _In_reads_(numSrcSurfaces) const PresentSurface* pSrcSurfaces, UINT numSrcSurfaces, _In_opt_ ID3D11On12DDIResource* pDest, _In_ D3DKMT_PRESENT* pKMTPresent) override;
-        STDMETHOD(PreExecuteCommandQueueCommand)(CommandListType commandListType) override;
-        STDMETHOD(PostExecuteCommandQueueCommand)(CommandListType commandListType) override;
+        STDMETHOD(PreExecuteCommandQueueCommand)(CommandListType commandListType) noexcept override;
+        STDMETHOD(PostExecuteCommandQueueCommand)(CommandListType commandListType) noexcept override;
 
         // Resource wrapping helpers
         STDMETHOD_(UINT, GetResourcePrivateDataSize)() noexcept final { return D3D12TranslationLayer::SharedResourceHelpers::cPrivateResourceDriverDataSize; }
diff --git a/include/layer.hpp b/include/layer.hpp
index 8686422..08da650 100644
--- a/include/layer.hpp
+++ b/include/layer.hpp
@@ -12,7 +12,7 @@ namespace D3D11On12
 
 
 #define OPEN_TRYCATCH \
-    HRESULT EntryPointHr = S_OK; \
+    [[maybe_unused]] HRESULT EntryPointHr = S_OK; \
     try \
     {
 
diff --git a/src/device.cpp b/src/device.cpp
index a40f007..fb757e7 100644
--- a/src/device.cpp
+++ b/src/device.cpp
@@ -1343,7 +1343,7 @@ namespace D3D11On12
         assert(SUCCEEDED(EntryPointHr));
     }
 
-    STDMETHODIMP_(HRESULT) Device::PreExecuteCommandQueueCommand(CommandListType commandListType)
+    STDMETHODIMP_(HRESULT) Device::PreExecuteCommandQueueCommand(CommandListType commandListType) noexcept
     {
         D3D11on12_DDI_ENTRYPOINT_START();
         auto clt = static_cast<D3D12TranslationLayer::COMMAND_LIST_TYPE>(commandListType);
@@ -1351,7 +1351,7 @@ namespace D3D11On12
         D3D11on12_DDI_ENTRYPOINT_END_AND_RETURN_HR(hr);
     }
 
-    STDMETHODIMP_(HRESULT) Device::PostExecuteCommandQueueCommand(CommandListType commandListType)
+    STDMETHODIMP_(HRESULT) Device::PostExecuteCommandQueueCommand(CommandListType commandListType) noexcept
     {
         D3D11on12_DDI_ENTRYPOINT_START();
         auto clt = static_cast<D3D12TranslationLayer::COMMAND_LIST_TYPE>(commandListType);
